{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2023-01-11 21:01:00', 'title': 'LOGITECH ANNOUNCES PRELIMINARY THIRD QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'LAUSANNE, SWITZERLAND & NEWARK, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SIX SWISS EXCHANGE AD HOC ANNOUNCEMENT PURSUANT TO ART. 53 LR — LOGITECH INTERNATIONAL (SIX: LOGN) (NASDAQ: LOGI) TODAY ANNOUNCED PRELIMINARY UNAUDITED FINANCIAL RESULTS RANGES FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2023 ENDED ON DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}